}],"participants":[{"person":"lvzang-p0022","role":"为广陵太守察纮孝廉者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-59e0f011d752be874350"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0048","role":"被察孝廉者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-59e0f011d752be874350"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-59e0f011d752be874350"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangyan-q-59e0f011d752be874350","order":9422},{"id":"zhangyan-e-3033eebab473cccca1fc","title":"赵昱后为笮融所杀，张纮甚伤愤而力不能讨，昱门户绝灭","accounts":[{"id":"zhangyan-a-3033eebab473cccca1fc","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"赵昱后为笮融所杀，张纮甚伤愤而力不能讨，昱门户绝灭","evidence":["zhangyan-q-128083f33178fdf1d643"]}],"participants":[{"person":"lvzang-p0022","role":"为笮融所杀者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-128083f33178fdf1d643"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0005","role":"杀昱者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-128083f33178fdf1d643"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0048","role":"伤愤而力不能讨者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-128083f33178fdf1d643"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-128083f33178fdf1d643"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangyan-q-128083f33178fdf1d643","order":9423}],"persons":[{"id":"lvzang-p0022","name":"赵昱","evidence":["lvzang-q-0f025883f3e6494ab446","gongsuntao-q-928aedf43971280b53e0","gongsuntao-q-c24714de0b7fdf86ac75","gongsuntao-q-56ad0ca6515d34c1d1c8","gongsuntao-q-0ca0923e99e083f041a5","gongsuntao-q-521c58bd9e1697bc36cd","gongsuntao-q-f21fa73bebceec33ffdc","gongsuntao-q-5f9a53bd359bdcf55dea","gongsuntao-q-19b1ca938bc77bb04e7e","zhanggu-q-109fac9237b4cf90f78f","zhonghua-q-d56dc6c524c8635c86b6","zhonghua-q-57bd27a9bfe105a2a27c","yaoci-q-6bcb897a27f1c50c5b51","yaoci-q-64accee8bd45d632b287","zhangyan-q-59e0f011d752be874350","zhangyan-q-128083f33178fdf1d643","zhangyan-q-838d68a9587b0e44b895"],"facts":[{"id":"gongsuntao-f-review-1133024519e331f48d28","text":"谢承《后汉书》记：年十三母病三月，惨戚消瘠至目不交睫，握粟出卜祈祷泣血，乡党称其孝；就处士东莞綦毋君受公羊传，兼该群业，潜志不窥园圃","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-5f9a53bd359bdcf55dea"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhanggu-m-96bb1ebddc2548c6bb12","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及赵昱","evidence":["zhanggu-q-7ba25ed9cc48e8a4dd7f"]},{"id":"zhangyan-m-3cebf3a8c6161b9b3d6a","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及赵昱，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-838d68a9587b0e44b895"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-0ca0923e99e083f041a5","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-3f8716405c0509ef7aba","layer":"pei","quote":"会黄巾作乱，陆梁五郡；郡县发兵，以为先办。徐州刺史巴祗表功第一，当受迁赏；昱深以为耻，委官还家","attribution":"裴注·后汉书（谢承）","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":139,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-337cc662c06000f4518b","start":190,"end":237,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-19b1ca938bc77bb04e7e","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-3f8716405c0509ef7aba","layer":"pei","quote":"昱年十三，母尝病，经涉三月。昱惨戚消瘠，至目不交睫，握粟出卜，祈祷泣血，乡党称其孝。就处士东莞綦毋君，受《公羊传》，兼该群业。至历年，潜志不窥园圃，亲疏希见其面；时入定省父母，须臾即还","attribution":"谢承《后汉书》","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":139,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-337cc662c06000f4518b","start":13,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-521c58bd9e1697bc36cd","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-3f8716405c0509ef7aba","layer":"pei","quote":"徐州牧陶谦初辟别驾从事，辞疾逊遁。谦重令扬州从事会稽吴范宣旨，昱守意不移；欲威以刑罚，然后乃起。举茂才。迁广陵大守","attribution":"裴注·后汉书（谢承）","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":139,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-337cc662c06000f4518b","start":238,"end":295,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-56ad0ca6515d34c1d1c8","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-3f8716405c0509ef7aba","layer":"pei","quote":"举孝廉，除莒长；宣扬五教，政为国表","attribution":"裴注·后汉书（谢承）","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":139,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-337cc662c06000f4518b","start":172,"end":189,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-5f9a53bd359bdcf55dea","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-3f8716405c0509ef7aba","layer":"pei","quote":"昱年十三，母尝病，经涉三月。昱惨戚消瘠，至目不交睫，握粟出卜，祈祷泣血，乡党称其孝。就处士东莞綦毋君，受《公羊传》，兼该群业。至历年，潜志不窥园圃，亲疏希见其面","attribution":"谢承《后汉书》","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":139,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-337cc662c06000f4518b","start":13,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-928aedf43971280b53e0","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-3b9195e9d2c3cd3bda4c","layer":"original","quote":"是时，徐州百姓殷盛，谷米丰赡，流民多归之，而谦背道任情。广陵太守琅邪赵昱，徐方名士也〖6〗，以忠直见疏；﹝四﹞曹宏等，谗慝小人也，谦亲任之：刑政失和，良善多被其害，由是渐乱","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":123,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-c24714de0b7fdf86ac75","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-3f8716405c0509ef7aba","layer":"pei","quote":"高洁廉正，抱礼而立；清英俨恪，莫干其志；旌善以兴化，殚邪以矫俗。州郡请召，常称病不应。国相檀谟、陈遵共召，不起；或兴盛怒，终不回意","attribution":"裴注·后汉书（谢承）","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":139,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-337cc662c06000f4518b","start":106,"end":171,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-f21fa73bebceec33ffdc","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-3f8716405c0509ef7aba","layer":"pei","quote":"贼笮融从临淮见讨，进入郡界。昱将兵拒战，败绩，见害","attribution":"裴注·后汉书（谢承）","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":139,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-337cc662c06000f4518b","start":296,"end":321,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-0f025883f3e6494ab446","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-718ad3d8e8b38caf44f8","layer":"original","quote":"时选三署郎，以补县长〖3〗：琅邪赵昱为莒长〖4〗，东莱刘繇下邑长〖5〗，东海王朗菑丘长〖6〗，洪即丘长","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-64accee8bd45d632b287","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-66f2d52fde94a20ba685","layer":"original","quote":"融利广陵之众〖30〗，因酒酣杀昱；放兵大略，因载而去","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-6bcb897a27f1c50c5b51","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-66f2d52fde94a20ba685","layer":"original","quote":"广陵太守赵昱待以宾礼","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-72aea34b910a2bd73592","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-66f2d52fde94a20ba685","layer":"original","quote":"融将男女万口，马三千匹，走广陵","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-109fac9237b4cf90f78f","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-acee24518fc66dcee7d3","layer":"original","quote":"刺史陶谦举茂才，不应；谦以为轻己，遂见拘执。昱倾身营救，方以得免","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":98,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-7ba25ed9cc48e8a4dd7f","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-acee24518fc66dcee7d3","layer":"original","quote":"与琅邪赵昱、东海王朗俱发名友善〖1〗。弱冠察孝廉〖2〗，不就。与朗共论旧君讳事〖3〗，州里才士陈琳等皆称善之","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":37,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-128083f33178fdf1d643","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-ba6e583185faf20d4400","layer":"pei","quote":"昱后为笮融所杀，纮甚伤愤，而力不能讨，昱门户绝灭","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":32,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-911a32786eb288af892f","start":207,"end":231,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-59e0f011d752be874350","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-ba6e583185faf20d4400","layer":"pei","quote":"初，琅邪赵昱，为广陵太守，察纮孝廉","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":32,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-911a32786eb288af892f","start":189,"end":206,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-838d68a9587b0e44b895","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-ba6e583185faf20d4400","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝五﹞《吴书》曰：“权初承统，春秋方富。太夫人以方外多难，深怀忧劳；数有优令辞谢，付属以辅助之义：纮辄拜笺答谢，思惟补察。每有异事密计及章表书记，与四方交结，常令纮与张昭草创撰作。纮以破虏有破走董卓、扶持汉室之勋，讨逆平定江外、建立大业：宜有纪颂，以昭公（义）〔美〕。既成，呈权。权省读悲感，曰：‘君真识孤家门阀阅也！’乃遣纮之部。或以纮本受北任，嫌其志趣不止于此，权不以介意。初，琅邪赵昱，为广陵太守，察纮孝廉；昱后为笮融所杀，纮甚伤愤，而力不能讨，昱门户绝灭。及纮在东部，遣主簿至琅邪设祭；并求亲戚为之后，以书属琅邪相臧宣：宣以赵宗中五岁男，奉昱祀。权闻而嘉之。及讨江夏，以东部少事，命纮居守，遥领所职。孔融遗纮书曰：‘闻大军西征，足下留镇。不有居者，谁守社稷？深固折冲，亦大勋也。无乃李广之气，苍发益怒，乐一当单于，以尽余愤乎？南北并定，世将无事；（孙叔）〔叔孙〕投戈，绛、灌俎豆，亦在今日；但用离析，无缘会面，为愁叹耳！道直途清，相见岂复难哉！’权以纮有镇守之劳，欲论功加赏。纮厚自挹损，不敢蒙宠：权不夺其志。每从容侍宴，微言密指，常有以规讽。”","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":32,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-911a32786eb288af892f","start":0,"end":477,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-57bd27a9bfe105a2a27c","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6bd6ba5ae0d7c26e5a54","layer":"original","quote":"谦乃遣昱，奉章至长安。天子嘉其意，拜谦安东将军；以昱为广陵太守，朗会稽太守。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":225,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":67,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-d56dc6c524c8635c86b6","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-6bd6ba5ae0d7c26e5a54","layer":"original","quote":"朗为谦治中，与别驾赵昱等说谦曰：“《春秋》之义，求诸侯莫如勤王〖4〗。今天子越在西京〖5〗，宜遣使奉承王命。”","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":225,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
